Man, if Ted Cruz thought he got booed harshly in New York,

00:04:58.367 --> 00:05:00.234
God help him in Philadelphia. Oh, man.

00:05:00.234 --> 00:05:01.968
Yeah, the World Series has kicked off

00:05:01.968 --> 00:05:03.801
with the Phillies taking on the Astros.

00:05:03.801 --> 00:05:06.467
And both sides are fired up. There's even some trash talking.

00:05:06.467 --> 00:05:08.701
Even the mascots are getting in on it.

00:05:08.701 --> 00:05:13.033
Yeah. Can we see the mascots? Yeah. It's been pretty heated.

