00:05:27.767 --> 00:05:29.734
Then the Philly Phanatic said...

00:05:32.801 --> 00:05:34.601
Then Orbit said...

00:05:39.067 --> 00:05:41.067
Then the Phanatic said...

00:05:44.367 --> 00:05:46.067
Then Orbit said...

00:05:47.767 --> 00:05:50.701
Then the Phanatic said...

00:05:50.701 --> 00:05:52.267
Then Orbit said...

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.567
-Wow!

00:06:00.400 --> 00:06:04.634
Uncalled for! Salty.

00:06:04.634 --> 00:06:06.968
-Let's check in with Steve Mandel for some bad --

00:06:06.968 --> 00:06:08.701
more bad Halloween advice. Steve?

00:06:08.701 --> 00:06:13.934
-Don't enter any strange vans, 'cause one of them is my home.

00:06:13.934 --> 00:06:15.901
