00:06:15.901 --> 00:06:20.167
-Smoke -- Smoke came out of his mouth when he said "home."

00:06:20.167 --> 00:06:21.834
-Home. -Home. Yeah.

00:06:21.834 --> 00:06:24.868
-Smoke came out -- Finally, new research shows

00:06:24.868 --> 00:06:27.300
